{"id":"2b88fdcc29f28660","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Transitive.md","title":"Transitive","display":"Transitive","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"Transitive","parameters":["w","r"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"Transitive"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>w</span><span>r</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：基础。有序参数：<code>w</code>、<code>r</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ Transitive w r)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(forall x\n  (implies\n    (in x w)\n    (forall y\n      (implies\n        (in y w)\n        (forall z (implies (in z w) (implies (and (@ Edge r x y) (@ Edge r y z)) (@ Edge r x z))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abaf67a121eca170\" href=\"?note=abaf67a121eca170\" title=\"ZFC_Edge\">Edge</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ Transitive w r)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Edge","status":"resolved","id":"abaf67a121eca170","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":866,"backlinks":[{"id":"170e22e2feddb645","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Symmetric|Symmetric]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]"},{"id":"23fc3019079f617c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Antisymmetric|Antisymmetric]]；[[ZFC_BinaryOperation|BinaryOperation]]；[[ZFC_BinaryValue|BinaryValue]]；[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]"},{"id":"7a9a6ec6fb6ca2f8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]；[[ZFC_Upset|Upset]]；[[ZFC_WorldVal|WorldVal]]"},{"id":"4911f5764eb9236a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_DirectedCones|DirectedCones]]；[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]；[[ZFC_Upset|Upset]]；[[ZFC_WorldVal|WorldVal]]"},{"id":"e9170a8afc11bfb4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_ConnectedCones|ConnectedCones]]；[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]；[[ZFC_Upset|Upset]]；[[ZFC_WorldVal|WorldVal]]"},{"id":"6c535786457e5cab","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"exce